mbers</span></span><span class=\"menu-row-badges\"><span class=\"badge badge-plan\">Team</span><!></span><!><!></button></li><!></ul></li><li role=\"presentation\" class=\"menu-section\"><div class=\"menu-section-heading\">Actions</div><ul role=\"group\" class=\"menu-section-rows\"><li role=\"none\" class=\"menu-row-item\"><button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"menu-row menu-row-action\"><span class=\"menu-row-leading\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-tile icon-tile-action\">+</span></span><span class=\"menu-row-text\"><span class=\"menu-row-title\">New workspace</span><span class=\"menu-row-subtitle\">Invite teammates after creating</span></span><!><!><!></button></li><li role=\"none\" class=\"menu-row-item\"><button role=\"menuitem\" class=\"menu-row menu-row-default\"><span class=\"menu-row-leading\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon-tile icon-tile-action\">⚙</span></span><span class=\"menu-row-text\"><span class=\"menu-row-title\">Workspace settings</span><!></span><!><!><!></button></li></ul></li></ul></div><footer class=\"popover-footer\"><div class=\"menu-footer\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:var(--text-tertiary);\">Workspaces sync across devices.</span></div></footer></div><h3 class=\"contact-sheet-heading\">Displays</h3><div class=\"contact-sheet-row\"><div class=\"display-source-card display-source-card-selected\"><header class=\"display-source-header\"><div class=\"display-source-label\"><span class=\"display-source-name\">Built-in Retina display</span><span class=\"display-source-size\">14\"</span><span aria-label=\"Favourite\" title=\"Favourite\" class=\"display-source-star\">★</span></div><div class=\"display-source-meta\"><span class=\"display-source-dims\">3024 × 1964</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"display-source-chevron\">▾</span></div></header><div class=\"display-preview\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;\"><div class=\"display-preview-titlebar\"><span class=\"display-preview-tlbtn display-preview-tlbtn-red\"></span><span cl